<p>11/15/2009		  295M    5.55  %</p>
<p>11/15/2016		2,620M    6.00  %</p>
<p>11/15/2025		6,090M    6.10  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 11/15/2006    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 11/15/2008</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Friday, September 20, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on October 10, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
